  @doc since: "1.8"
  @doc ~S"""
  Returns element attribute value.

  > #### Discouraged {: .warning}
  >
  > Use locator-based `PlaywrightEx.Locator.get_attribute/3` instead. Read more about [locators](https://playwright.dev/docs/locators).

